msgstr "这里有街机、一张台球桌、一张乒乓球桌,以及配有电竞椅的电脑。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_construct.html.heex:140
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Construct, the office and the game room are part of the space's gathering, which stays open while anybody is in one of them."
msgstr "构造空间,办公室和游戏室是空间聚会的一部分,在其中之一有人时,空间聚会会保持开放."

